# Applied by BuildKit as the ignore file of deploy/docker/Dockerfile (<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore beside it takes
# precedence over a .dockerignore at the context root). The Dockerfile also copies an explicit list of paths, so
# nothing below can reach the image; this keeps them out of the build context as well.
.git
node_modules
.planning
.omp
.cursor
.grok
*.log
coverage
docs/superpowers
issues
# Secrets: an env file next to the compose example must never be sent to the builder.
.env
.env.*
*.env
**/*.env
.mcp.json
